cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this leakage-audit toolkit, please cite the associated paper."
title: "Leakage-Audit Toolkit for small-sample materials-ML regression corpora"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Ti6Al4V LPBF Project authors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/WangHan2304/leakage-audit-toolkit"
abstract: >-
  Material-agnostic data-integrity checks (A1--A5 leakage audits and three
  cheap pre-modeling screens) for small-sample materials-ML regression corpora,
  validated on three laser powder-bed fusion alloys (Ti-6Al-4V, 316L,
  Inconel 718).
keywords:
  - leakage audit
  - cross-validation
  - materials informatics
  - laser powder bed fusion
  - data provenance
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
